        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Mil</strong> is a difficult platformer in which you have to complete many levels filled with a lot of obstacles. The game has over 100 levels, various location themes, music, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into two difficulty modes: normal mode and hard mode. The locations are the same, but the hard mode is more challenging because there are more obstacles, requiring greater precision and accuracy, which is what hardcore gamers appreciate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/420188a484a194bbe10961df0953b97d.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/420188a484a194bbe10961df0953b97d.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/420188a484a194bbe10961df0953b97d.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who have little or no experience in this genre, the game offers a practice mode where you can set checkpoints and train on levels where you encounter difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/0114e19579ef0550594e2afff20d55f3.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/0114e19579ef0550594e2afff20d55f3.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/0114e19579ef0550594e2afff20d55f3.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a separate section with additional levels that are immediately available for completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels have hidden puzzles, for collecting which you can unlock an additional story section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/191db5790019aa96f8e9bab8320d14f8.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/191db5790019aa96f8e9bab8320d14f8.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/191db5790019aa96f8e9bab8320d14f8.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Maker with Steam Workshop support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels using the built-in editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish your creations to the Workshop and try out other players levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/2b544ac1517d1b37e7ff3c856f5bebce.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/2b544ac1517d1b37e7ff3c856f5bebce.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/2b544ac1517d1b37e7ff3c856f5bebce.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Help Mil to complete this long way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">and try not to break the keyboard</span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Mil</strong> is a difficult platformer in which you have to complete many levels filled with a lot of obstacles. The game has over 100 levels, various location themes, music, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into two difficulty modes: normal mode and hard mode. The locations are the same, but the hard mode is more challenging because there are more obstacles, requiring greater precision and accuracy, which is what hardcore gamers appreciate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/420188a484a194bbe10961df0953b97d.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/420188a484a194bbe10961df0953b97d.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/420188a484a194bbe10961df0953b97d.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who have little or no experience in this genre, the game offers a practice mode where you can set checkpoints and train on levels where you encounter difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/0114e19579ef0550594e2afff20d55f3.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/0114e19579ef0550594e2afff20d55f3.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/0114e19579ef0550594e2afff20d55f3.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a separate section with additional levels that are immediately available for completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels have hidden puzzles, for collecting which you can unlock an additional story section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/191db5790019aa96f8e9bab8320d14f8.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/191db5790019aa96f8e9bab8320d14f8.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/191db5790019aa96f8e9bab8320d14f8.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Maker with Steam Workshop support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels using the built-in editor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish your creations to the Workshop and try out other players levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/2b544ac1517d1b37e7ff3c856f5bebce.poster.avif?t=1782233692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/2b544ac1517d1b37e7ff3c856f5bebce.webm?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053720/extras/2b544ac1517d1b37e7ff3c856f5bebce.mp4?t=1782233692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Help Mil to complete this long way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">and try not to break the keyboard</span></p>",
